      "uid": "zhcn:609edce3c58491efdc85dd8b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……推广苫小牧资讯的贴文，\n和其他的贴文相比，反应没什么变化。",
      "source_fingerprint": "229b6f240c99b5f2ba709b62d0838351ec3e3fb77a9aa1862ac40b3e786f7aee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
