    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67263673f159a060a51d6b65",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……明明我最希望大家看的，\n就是苫小牧的资讯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ef1c4fcf004de88025fe0deaa0833c8b52a001e590494e16fbabc8b73a5f609",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17f9d557c030464a61160291",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我很好奇，便用自己的手机查看了对贴文的\n反应变化。推广苫小牧资讯的贴文看起来\n确实不像其他贴文那样有明显的变化。",
      "source_fingerprint": "966b4d773c7ff05e5c50b5b4e36d324881b0510da64ffe98275cf6c81d853818",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d13ad7d497611b722e090cf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以后他们一定会去看的喔",
      "source_fingerprint": "39c8cf404e5d692df1ea3c64f6f76be3c10e045b937216c266dd3dfedc8cb310",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12666e128ac8dc9c4e9765b0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但这绝对不是因为什么都没改变。\n只是其他类别的贴文变化太大了而已，\n在看苫小牧推广资讯的人也稳健增加了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8133ffde4ad82c853582426986248a811be2b69f59bf0e89b52c98e01118434",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc7d1a5b60bdfba45ba96773",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只要她接下来继续在比赛中进步，\n就算现在只有小小的变化，\n总有一天肯定会有更多的人知道。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3064ac8589d373f5f8a306b2aa8445a5a8f3559d5774edcc89ddc1cd786658c8",
